0320101,"nextRandomTalks":[],"nextTalks":[],"npcId":[1036,1034],"performCfg":"QuestDialogue/LQ/Shougun2_12032/Q1203201","priority":5,"questId":12032,"showRandomTalkCount":0},"dialogs":[{"nodeId":120320101,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"雷電将軍","textMapHash":3029391042,"text":"この先、稲妻には数多くの試練が待ち構えているでしょう。ですが、私にはその準備がもうできています。","nextNodeIds":[120320102,120320107,120320112,120320117,120320122,120320128]},{"nodeId":120320102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":4002783882,"text":"「試練」について…","nextNodeIds":[120320103]},{"nodeId":120320103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"雷電将軍","textMapHash":3220769498,"text":"鎖国令を解除すれば、必然的に様々なものに影響します。利益のみで害がないとは言い切れません。","nextNodeIds":[120320104]},{"nodeId":120320104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"雷電将軍","textMapHash":1274715930,"text":"例えばすでに予測できるものが、他国による稲妻の商業への影響です。これは私が次に取り組むべきものとなるでしょう。","nextNodeIds":[120320105]},{"nodeId":120320105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":4041795282,"text":"影は本当に真面目じゃのう。妾がいま考えておるのは、鳴神大社で入場券を販売するか否かだというのに。","nextNodeIds":[120320106]},{"nodeId":120320106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"雷電将軍","textMapHash":3622183618,"text":"あなたという人は…","nextNodeIds":[120320101]},{"nodeId":120320107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2482335586,"text":"神の眼差しについて…","nextNodeIds":[120320108]},{"nodeId":120320108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"雷電将軍","textMapHash":2091415914,"text":"眞の眼差しは常に稲妻の民にありました。それが彼女の責任であると、昔の私はそう考えていたのです。","nextNodeIds":[120320109]},{"nodeId":120320109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"雷電将軍","textMapHash":964167730,"text":"しかし今になってやっと、その眼差しに称賛と期待が込められていたのが分かりました。責任とは別に、彼女はそれを喜びとしていたのです。彼女は人々を愛していました。","nextNodeIds":[120320110]},{"nodeId":120320110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":359902954,"text":"過去の人々は眼差しを向けるに値した。それは現在と未来の人々においても同じことじゃ。","nextNodeIds":[120320111]},{"nodeId":120320111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"雷電将軍","textMapHash":962760098,"text":"ええ、私はもう彼らの情熱と夢を無視することはありません。","nextNodeIds":[120320101]},{"nodeId":120320112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2859083954,"text":"何百年も続いた戦いについて…","nextNodeIds":[120320113]},{"nodeId":120320113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"雷電将軍","textMapHash":211919330,"text":"正直言って、あれは終わりの見えない苦痛でした。","nextNodeIds":[120320114]},{"nodeId":120320114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"雷電将軍","textMapHash":1760853666,"text":"果てしない戦いを前にした時、常に精神を研ぎ澄ませる必要があります。少しでも気を緩めれば、将軍の刀が私の命を奪っていたでしょう。","nextNodeIds":[120320115]},{"nodeId":120320115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"雷電将軍","textMapHash":188872170,"text":"今までの経験と見聞がなかったら…そして刀に力がこもっていなかったら…敗れていたのは私だったはずです。","nextNodeIds":[120320116]},{"nodeId":120320116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"雷電将軍","textMapHash":3303389290,"text":"これについては、あなたのおかげでもありますね。","nextNodeIds":[120320101]},{"nodeId":120320117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":675191746,"text":"神櫻が負った傷について…","nextNodeIds":[120320118]},{"nodeId":120320118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"雷電将軍","textMapHash":3706019914,"text":"安心してください。もちろん忘れてはいませんよ。天領奉行と社奉行には私から伝えておきます。","nextNodeIds":[120320119]},{"nodeId":120320119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"雷電将軍","textMapHash":3896121210,"text":"ただ魔物の脅威以外にも、神櫻から他のものが漏れ出ないかが心配です。","nextNodeIds":[120320120]},{"nodeId":120320120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":845736394,"text":"それはまだはっきりとは言えぬ。記憶以外にも、地脈には多くのものが入っておるからのう。","nextNodeIds":[120320121]},{"nodeId":120320121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"雷電将軍","textMapHash":1792657330,"text":"あなたも当事者なんですから、怠けないでくださいね。","nextNodeIds":[120320101]},{"nodeId":120320122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3990755842,"text":"八重神子が影を自分の神だって…","nextNodeIds":[120320123]},{"nodeId":120320123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":4167447194,"text":"汝よ、当人の前でふざけたデマを言うでない。","nextNodeIds":[120320124]},{"nodeId":120320124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":3917380146,"text":"この世には、そう軽々しく何度も口にしてはならぬ言葉がある。","nextNodeIds":[120320125]},{"nodeId":120320125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":1571321106,"text":"妾を裏切ることがどんな代価を払うことになるのか、そんなもの知りたくはないじゃろう？妾の言ったあれは汝と妾だけの秘密じゃ、よいな？","nextNodeIds":[120320126]},{"nodeId":120320126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1036,"speakerName":"雷電将軍","textMapHash":1098946098,"text":"何の話をしているのですか？","nextNodeIds":[120320127]},{"nodeId":120320127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1034,"speakerName":"八重神子","textMapHash":629983346,"text":"なんでもない、油揚げが食べたくなっただけじゃ。","nextNodeIds":[120320101]},{"nodeId":120320128,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2102008066,"text":"他に聞きたいことは特にない。","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1203201,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_FINISH_PLOT","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[3,60],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_LEAVE_SCENE_RANGE","PPFLKMOMKAI":"Q1204209_N1036"},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1914201,2],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""},{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[1914511,2],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_QUEST_STATE_EQUAL","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":